Hand-maintained: package() drops eudev's own usr/sbin/udevadm compatibility
symlink, which cannot be expressed in manifest.tsv's template. ScrapLinux is a
merged-/usr system (/usr/sbin -> bin), so that symlink and the real binary at
usr/bin/udevadm are the same path - unpacking the package wrote the binary and
then replaced it with a link to itself, leaving udevadm unusable and every
coldplug silently doing nothing. See the comment in package().
